{"metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure","modules":[{"name":"GraphOperations"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SubgraphView"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SubgraphView","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"SubgraphView","remoteSource":{"fileName":"SubgraphView.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/GraphOperations\/SubgraphView.swift#L31"},"symbolKind":"struct","externalID":"s:15GraphOperations12SubgraphViewV"},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GraphOperations\/documentation\/GraphOperations"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"A subgraph of a graph, as a lazy view: some of its vertices and some of its edges, renumbered","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"densely. Made by ","type":"text"},{"code":"inducedSubgraphView(on:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"spanningSubgraphView(edges:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"subgraphView(vertices:edges:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GraphOperations\/documentation\/GraphOperations\/SubgraphView\/DirectedEdges","doc:\/\/GraphOperations\/documentation\/GraphOperations\/SubgraphView\/EdgeIndexRow","doc:\/\/GraphOperations\/documentation\/GraphOperations\/SubgraphView\/EdgeRow","doc:\/\/GraphOperations\/documentation\/GraphOperations\/SubgraphView\/IndexRow","doc:\/\/GraphOperations\/documentation\/GraphOperations\/SubgraphView\/UndirectedEdges"],"anchor":"Structures"},{"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GraphOperations\/documentation\/GraphOperations\/SubgraphView\/base"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"generated":true,"title":"Subscripts","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GraphOperations\/documentation\/GraphOperations\/SubgraphView\/subscript(_:checked:)-2n5fj","doc:\/\/GraphOperations\/documentation\/GraphOperations\/SubgraphView\/subscript(_:checked:)-34kf9","doc:\/\/GraphOperations\/documentation\/GraphOperations\/SubgraphView\/subscript(_:checkedEdgeAt:)-40a5z","doc:\/\/GraphOperations\/documentation\/GraphOperations\/SubgraphView\/subscript(_:checkedEdgeAt:)-7lnri","doc:\/\/GraphOperations\/documentation\/GraphOperations\/SubgraphView\/subscript(_:of:)-16yvl","doc:\/\/GraphOperations\/documentation\/GraphOperations\/SubgraphView\/subscript(_:of:)-3uhp3","doc:\/\/GraphOperations\/documentation\/GraphOperations\/SubgraphView\/subscript(_:ofEdgeAt:)-1tfjm","doc:\/\/GraphOperations\/documentation\/GraphOperations\/SubgraphView\/subscript(_:ofEdgeAt:)-8bx4q"],"anchor":"Subscripts"},{"generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GraphOperations\/documentation\/GraphOperations\/SubgraphView\/BidirectionalDirectedGraph-Implementations","doc:\/\/GraphOperations\/documentation\/GraphOperations\/SubgraphView\/BidirectionalDirectedGraph-Implementations","doc:\/\/GraphOperations\/documentation\/GraphOperations\/SubgraphView\/DirectedGraph-Implementations","doc:\/\/GraphOperations\/documentation\/GraphOperations\/SubgraphView\/DirectedGraph-Implementations","doc:\/\/GraphOperations\/documentation\/GraphOperations\/SubgraphView\/Graph-Implementations","doc:\/\/GraphOperations\/documentation\/GraphOperations\/SubgraphView\/Graph-Implementations","doc:\/\/GraphOperations\/documentation\/GraphOperations\/SubgraphView\/GraphAdaptor-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SubgraphView","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Base","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The kept vertices appear in the base’s order at view indices "},{"code":"0..<vertexCount","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". The view keeps"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"two arrays, base index to view index and back, so a row is the base’s row filtered and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"renumbered with one array load per entry. A spanning subgraph keeps every vertex at its base"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"index."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Edges keep the base’s positions, so a weight closure keyed by the base’s positions works on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the view. An edge is in the view when both its ends are and, if an edge set was given, when it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is in the set. With an edge set the view has dense edge indices, an edge’s index being its rank"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"among the kept edges in base order. Over a base with edge indices the set is a bit mask with a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"count per 64-bit word, and a rank costs one popcount. Over a base without them (an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AdjacencyMatrix"},{"type":"text","text":", a complement, an induced subgraph) the set is the sorted kept positions, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a row entry or a rank costs a binary search. An induced subgraph has no edge indices, except one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that keeps every vertex, which keeps the base’s rows and edge indices."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The view holds a copy of the base, so mutating the original doesn’t show through. The base","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"must have vertex indices; construction traps when ","type":"text"},{"code":"vertexIndexBound","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"As a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GraphAdaptor"},{"text":", its generation is the base’s, and it reads the base’s attached maps.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"[map, of: vertex]"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"[map, ofEdgeAt: position]"},{"text":" trap for a vertex or an edge the view drops,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and their ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"checked:"},{"text":" forms throw. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"values(of:)"},{"text":" is the base’s, by the base’s positions. An","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"algorithm on the view reads it only at the kept edges.","type":"text"}]}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/GraphOperations\/documentation\/GraphOperations\/SubgraphView"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/graphoperations\/subgraphview"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/BidirectionalDirectedGraph","doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph","doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph","doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/GraphAdaptor","doc:\/\/GraphOperations\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/GraphOperations\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/GraphOperations\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/GraphOperations\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://GraphOperations/documentation/GraphOperations/SubgraphView/subscript(_:ofEdgeAt:)-8bx4q":{"conformance":{"constraints":[{"code":"Base","ty